{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/84d776017867/ch06",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 6,
      "location": "隊伍在普里茲港尋找賢者約拿不遇,反遭王國巡邏隊盤查。為保護護衛(通緝犯艾迪·沙林斯)與王國軍爆發衝突,幸得貝克威協助化解,得知約拿已離港調查連日失蹤事件,約定王城會合。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_006",
      "title": "第六章 — 普里茲港風波,結識貝克威"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "奇怪了,約拿好像不在城裡,只好先來這裡找找看了.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "巡邏隊盤查"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "前面好像有士兵在巡邏,大家要小心點!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "喂!你們站住!這裡不是禁止進入了嗎?你們來這裡幹什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "真抱歉,我們是來找人的.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "找什麼找,這裡什麼人都沒有!回去回去!....咦?等等,你們通通給我站住!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "又怎麼了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "你是艾迪·沙林斯吧!自從上次你們一夥搶劫了維克勒城之後,我們一直在找你,想不到你居然跑去當別人的護衛了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "多"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "text": "........"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "所以啊,我看你還是乖乖束手就擒,跟我們回去,這樣對你比較好。嗯?"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "護衛爭執"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "等一下!護衛是爸爸派給我的,你們要抓走他,叫我回去怎麼交代?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "那可不干我們的事!再無理取鬧的話,就連妳也一起逮捕!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "你敢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "那邊在吵什麼吵?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "隊長,我在這群人中發現一個通緝犯,但他的主人拒絕讓我們逮捕他。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "那就全部抓起來!拒捕者格殺勿論!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "看來我們又有麻煩了,索爾,怎麼辦?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這些士兵也太蠻橫了!亞雷斯,我們上!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "這下子想不打都不行嘍!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/3"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "萊汀出面"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "看你們的身手不像是普通人,你們到底是誰?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "剛剛說過了,我們只是普通了旅行者罷了"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "不可能!你們絕對不是普通的旅行者!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "信不信由你了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "可恨!這些人還真強!,弟兄們再撐一會兒萊汀大人就來了,再撐一會兒!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "看他們的樣子似乎還有援軍!大家,先把小隊長打倒吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "手"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/6",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/6",
          "text": "小隊長,這是怎麼一回事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "萊..萊汀大人!這一群匪徒公然拒捕,他們戰技高超,我們正嘗試要拿下他.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "手"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/8",
          "text": "原來不過是些匪徒而已,通通給我抓起來!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "你..你們不是一般匪徒,你們..到底有何目的?.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/4/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這一切只是誤會而已,我們─"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/4"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "X"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/5/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/84d776017867/scenes/5/lines/0",
          "text": "隊..隊長!這..這是怎麼回事?!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/5/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "史恩!快去通報邊境守衛隊,叫他們追捕這批匪徒,我..我已經盡力了..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "史恩"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/5/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/84d776017867/scenes/5/lines/2",
          "text": "隊..隊長!你放心,這件事我一定辦到!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/84d776017867/scenes/5"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "貝克威解圍"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "天啊!你們居然攻擊王國派來的調查隊,還把小隊長給殺了,難道你們不怕被全王國軍通緝嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "這只是一場誤會,可是他們不肯聽我們解釋...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "唉,現在說什麼都沒用啦!你們到底是來幹什麼的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "我們來此找賢者約拿.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "你們是來找約拿的?約拿兩天前就已經離開此地了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "為什麼?聽說他近年來很少離開普里茲港的啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "是沒錯。不過這個港城最近夜裡發生不少樁失蹤事件,狀況嚴重到連王國都派守備隊來調查了,想必你們還不知道吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "怪不得碼頭一帶到處都是士兵。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "我叫做貝克威,和約拿算是滿熟的朋友。前兩天他來找我,說他發現一件大陰謀,和連日來的失蹤事件有關,必須立刻前去調查。他委託我一些事之後就離開了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "真倒楣,那這趟不就又白跑了嗎?還因此和王國軍結了怨.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 10,
              "speaker_name": "瑪琳"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-10",
          "text": "你是在指我嗎?這又不全是我的錯!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "妳還敢說,要不是因為妳爸爸派給妳的護衛.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "好啦好啦!吵架解決不了事情,這樣吧,約拿約了我兩天後到亞克斯王國的王城去和他碰面,既然你們有事找他,就和我一起去好了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "嗄?到王城去?那我們不是自投羅網嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "這個你們倒可以不用擔心,我保證一定不會有事的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "希莉亞,妳為什麼敢做這種保證?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "這是秘密,不告訴你!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好,既然如此,我們就準備上路吧!貝克威先生,您怎樣呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/84d776017867/scenes/6/lines/18",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "先和我回城裏一趟,等我收拾一下東西,待會兒就可以啟程了。走吧!"
        }
